  "explanation": "The agent made a reasoning error by incorrectly interpreting the condition \"an average increase of below 6.5% between 2013 and 2015 for total passenger numbers\" as a single year-over-year increase from 2014 to 2015. It also incorrectly assumed that if an airport did not win any Skytrax awards between 2000 and 2010, it still met the condition of winning \"less than six times,\" leading to a broad list of candidates and an arbitrary final selection.",
